## amount to pay

from your 2.comms.on=$date.mech=phone.subj=apv-recalc.grain=final.md:

| item | amount |
|------|--------|
| taxes | $ |
| penalties | $ |
| interest | $ |
| annual report fee × years (their quoted figure) | $ |
| **total** | **$** |

⚠️ **this table must match step 2's emit table row for row.** the report-fee row
was added to both on 2026-09-02 — it is owed per delinquent year, and **neither**
`franchise.tax.delaware` (which prints `⬅️ tax only`) nor `.accrue` produces it,
so it is silent in both tools. take the figure from what Delaware quoted on the
call.

