## payment steps (online)

1. go to https://corp.delaware.gov/paytaxes/
2. enter file number: [YOUR FILE NUMBER]
3. verify corporation name matches
4. enter payment amount — the **recalculated** total from the table above,
   NOT the original Authorized-Shares-Method assessment the site may still
   display
5. select payment method
6. complete payment
7. save confirmation number

---

## important

if the online system shows the old (higher) amount:

⛔ **first ask whether the reports are actually on file, per year.** per the
precondition at the head of this stone, that figure is the § 502(c) assessment
and it stands until a complete § 503(b) report displaces it. a call will not move
it, and a payment against it is a payment of the Authorized-Shares number.

only once every delinquent year has a complete report on file:
- call Delaware to confirm the recalculation is applied
- they may need to manually adjust before you can pay online
- alternatively, pay by phone with the reference number from your call

> 🚩 **these three lines read as the whole remedy until a later pass**, which put
> the reader's first move on the phone when the statute puts it on the report.
> the lines are kept — they are correct *after* the reports land — under the
> precondition that was previously absent.

